.TH "GLESHA-HELP" "1" "" "glesha" "User Commands"
.nh
.ad l
.SH NAME
glesha\-help \- show help for a command
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBglesha help\fR [COMMAND [ACTION]] [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the options and examples of COMMAND, or of one catalog or state ACTION. Without arguments, list all commands. 'glesha COMMAND \-\-help' is equivalent.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
The global options described in glesha(1) are also accepted.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
glesha help run
glesha help catalog unlock
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR glesha (1)
